bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    simple_audio_cuda_q15_intermittent_device_failure_2026_11_26, 0, "Split from cuda_gpu_gated_spec_defects_2026-08-09 item 4.3. With libsimple_audio_cuda.so built by scripts/build/build_simple_audio_cuda_sffi.shs (clang) on LD_LIBRARY_PATH, test/03_system/io_audio/simple_audio_cuda_q15_env_spec.spl (SIMPLE_CUDA_TEST=1) passes with exact device samples in some runs and fails in others with cuda-audio-readback-failed or cuda-audio-module-load-failed. The C shim discards every CUresult (module_load returns 0, upload/download/launch/sync collapse to status), so the failing driver call is unknown. Candidate, unproven: the shim creates its own context in simple_audio_cuda_open and never makes it current again before later calls."

